ile/fse-2025/lianli\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Lian Li\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/lianli/2d38ce3b-d5f4-46da-9425-e01fd6272393/micro-avatar?1783976633000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Lian Li<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Institute of Computing Technology at Chinese Academy of Sciences; University of Chinese Academy of Sciences</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/fse-2025/jinglingxue\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Jingling Xue\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/jinglingxue/1112e38f-6afd-4e73-b015-8d13c31eb23a/micro-avatar?1783974767000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Jingling Xue<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">University of New South Wales</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Australia</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading clearfix\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><strong><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-log-in\"></span> Information for Participants</strong></div></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"well well-sm\"><strong>Mon 23 Jun 2025 10:30 - 12:30 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/fse-2025/fse-2025-venue-cosmos-3c\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Cosmos 3C</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers#program\" class=\"navigate\">Vulnerability 1</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/fse-2025/cuiyungao\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Cuiyun Gao</a></small><div class=\"text-muted\">Info for room <strong>Cosmos 3C</strong>: </div><blockquote class=\"info-participants\"><p>Cosmos 3C is the third room in the Cosmos 3 wing.</p>\n<p>When facing the main Cosmos Hall, access to the Cosmos 3 wing is on the left, close to the stairs. The area is accessed through a large door with the number \u201C3\u201D, which will stay open during the event.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers/65/VulPA-Detecting-Semantically-Recurring-Vulnerabilities-with-Multi-Object-Typestate-A\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-9a27516d-37ac-4601-a68b-5f545047266c').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
